    rocsolver_larfg_template(..., (ipiv + tau_idx), ...);
}

// Tau mapping:
// Row 0 → tau[0]
// Row 1 → tau[1]
// ...
// Row dim-1 → tau[dim-1]
```

GELQ2 uses forward storage because:
- Processes top-to-bottom
- tau[j] naturally maps to row j
- Q = H_0 * H_1 * ... * H_{dim-1} (forward order)

